 the square on $x^2-5x+2$.\n\nFill in the nonnegative numbers.\n\n$x^2-5x+2=(x-$ {{field-1}} $)^2-$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "d975efd5-776a-5e85-ae06-55c19beda014" :question/worked-solution "The half of the linear coefficient is $-\\frac{5}{2}$. **Add and subtract** its square so the expression keeps its value.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx^2-5x+2&=\\underbrace{x^2-2\\cdot \\frac{5}{2}x+\\frac{25}{4}}_{\\text{perfect square}}-\\frac{25}{4}+2 \\\\\n&=\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2-\\frac{25}{4}+2 \\\\\n&=\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2-\\frac{17}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe minus sign inside the square produces the required linear term $-5x$.\n\nThe blanks are $\\frac{5}{2}$ and $\\frac{17}{4}$; the sign before the second blank is already supplied."] [:db/add "d975efd5-776a-5e85-ae06-55c19beda014" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "d975efd5-776a-5e85-ae06-55c19beda014" :question/answer-fields "c1459ae0-b54d-527b-82f8-df4d5ca16cf9"] [:db/add "d975efd5-776a-5e85-ae06-55c19beda014" :question/answer-fields "0fc17da4-afd4-5ffd-8a5f-ce4dd6afd71f"] [:db/ensure "d975efd5-776a-5e85-ae06-55c19beda014" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184170 :knowledge-point/questions "d975efd5-776a-5e85-ae06-55c19beda014"] [:db/add "cc46b6ec-3cc5-567f-a6ae-f1a48b9ba36c" :answer/id #uuid "cc46b6ec-3cc5-567f-a6ae-f1a48b9ba36c"] [:db/add "cc46b6ec-3cc5-567f-a6ae-f1a48b9ba36c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cc46b6ec-3cc5-567f-a6ae-f1a48b9ba36c" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "cc46b6ec-3cc5-567f-a6ae-f1a48b9ba36c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ba3f1d7f-3fbe-50c1-80b7-4b3a19786bda" :answer-field/id #uuid "ba3f1d7f-3fbe-50c1-80b7-4b3a19786bda"] [:db/add "ba3f1d7f-3fbe-50c1-80b7-4b3a19786bda" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "ba3f1d7f-3fbe-50c1-80b7-4b3a19786bda" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ba3f1d7f-3fbe-50c1-80b7-4b3a19786bda" :answer-field/choices "cc46b6ec-3cc5-567f-a6ae-f1a48b9ba36c"] [:db/add "ba3f1d7f-3fbe-50c1-80b