lf of the linear coefficient is $-\\frac{11}{2}$. **Add and subtract** its square so the expression keeps its value.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny^2-11y+\\frac{129}{4}&=\\underbrace{y^2-2\\cdot \\frac{11}{2}y+\\frac{121}{4}}_{\\text{perfect square}}-\\frac{121}{4}+\\frac{129}{4} \\\\\n&=\\left(y-\\frac{11}{2}\\right)^2-\\frac{121}{4}+\\frac{129}{4} \\\\\n&=\\left(y-\\frac{11}{2}\\right)^2+2.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe minus sign inside the square produces the required linear term $-11y$.\n\nThe blanks are $\\frac{11}{2}$ and $2$; the sign before the second blank is already supplied."] [:db/add "14c1673e-fdd8-5661-b83e-c945f222f620" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "14c1673e-fdd8-5661-b83e-c945f222f620" :question/answer-fields "4f1f25ae-113d-5aca-be66-95a30cafe0ff"] [:db/add "14c1673e-fdd8-5661-b83e-c945f222f620" :question/answer-fields "3a0d1f52-ff5e-5cee-ac3e-85d2e1de5b18"] [:db/ensure "14c1673e-fdd8-5661-b83e-c945f222f620" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184170 :knowledge-point/questions "14c1673e-fdd8-5661-b83e-c945f222f620"] [:db/add "6df920e6-7257-5b65-9c8a-956547ed43af" :answer/id #uuid "6df920e6-7257-5b65-9c8a-956547ed43af"] [:db/add "6df920e6-7257-5b65-9c8a-956547ed43af" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6df920e6-7257-5b65-9c8a-956547ed43af" :answer/value "\\frac{9}{2}"] [:db/ensure "6df920e6-7257-5b65-9c8a-956547ed43af" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9ab4bbe8-7553-5b56-8103-8bce765e7ee5" :answer-field/id #uuid "9ab4bbe8-7553-5b56-8103-8bce765e7ee5"] [:db/add "9ab4bbe8-7553-5b56-8103-8bce765e7ee5" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "9ab4bbe8-7553-5b56-8103-8bce765e7ee5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "9ab4bbe8-7553-5b56-8103-8bce765e7ee5" :answer-field/choices "6df920e6-7257-5b65-9c8a-956547ed43af"] [:db/add "9ab4bbe8-7553-5b56-8103-8bce765e7ee5" :answer-field/correct "6df920e6-7257-5b65-9c8a-956547ed43af"] [:db/ensure "9ab4bbe8-7553-5b56-8103-8bce765e7ee5" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "fce94ba7-1e7c-5ac5-84f6-18a0a045c830" :answer/id #uuid "fce94ba7-1e7c-5ac5-84f6-18a0a045c830"] [:db/add "fce94ba7-1e7c-5ac5-84f6-18a0a045c830" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fce94ba7-1e7c-5ac5-84f6-18a0a045c830" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}"] [:db/ensure "fce94ba7-1e7c-5ac5-84f6-18a0a045c830" :answer/validate] [:db/add "251080fb-8ea0-58e0-b0e2-2493aef4443d" :answer-field/id #uuid "251080fb-8ea0-58e0-b0e2-2493aef4443d"] [:db/add "251080fb-8ea0-58e0-b0e2-2493aef4443d" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "251080fb-8ea0-58e0-b0e2-2493aef4443d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "251080fb-8ea0-58e0-b0e2-2493aef4443d" :answer-field/choices "fce94ba7-1e7c-5ac5-84f6-18a0a045c830"] [:db/add "251080fb-8ea0-58e0-b0e2-2493aef4443d" :answer-field/correct "fce94ba7-1e7c-5ac5-84f6-18a0a045c830"] [:db/ensure "251080fb-8ea0-58e0-b0e2-2493aef4443d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f88ffce3-b2be-5e7d-b07a-b4d0d0cf5de2" :question/id #uuid "f88ffce3-b2be-5e7d-b07a-b4d0d0cf5de2"] [:db/add "f88ffce3-b2be-5e7d-b07a-b4d0d0cf5de2" :question/problem "Complete the square on $z^2-9z+\\frac{41}{2}$.\n\nFill in the nonnegative numbers.\n\n$z^2-9z+\\frac{41}{2}=(z-$ {{field-1}} $)^2+$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "f88ffce3-b2be-5e7d-b07a-b4d0d0cf5de2" :question/worked-solution "The half of the linear coefficient is $-\\frac{9}{2}$. **Add and subtract** its square so the expression keeps its value.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nz^2-9z+\\frac{41}{2}&=\\underbrace{z^2-2\\cdot \\frac{9}{2}z+\\frac{81}{4}}_{\\text{perfect square}}-\\frac{81}{4}+\\frac{41}{2} \\\\\n&=\\left(z-\\frac{9}{2}\\right)^2-\\frac{81}{4}+\\frac{41}{2} \\\\\n&=\\left(z-\\frac{9}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{1}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe minus sign inside the square produces the required linear term $-9z$.\n\nThe blanks are $\\frac{9}{2}$ and $\\frac{1}{4}$; the sign before the second blank is already supplied."] [:db/add "f88ffce3-b2be-5e7d-b07a-b4d0d0cf5de2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "